{
  "hadith_number": 23,
  "text": "On the authority of Abu Malik al-Harith, it been asked in Al-Ashari, May Allah be pleased with him. He said, the messenger of Allah, may the blessings and peace of Allah be upon him, said, purity is half of faith, Allah hummed Allah, praise be to Allah, fills the scales, and Subhan Allah, how far is Allah from every imperfection, and al-Hamdulillah, praise be to Allah, fill that which is between heaven and earth. Prayer is light, charity is proof, patience is illumination, and the Quran is an argument for, or against you. Everyone starts his day and is a vendor of his soul, either throwing it or bringing it's ruined. It was related by Muslim.",
